---

import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import LinkedInIcon from '../components/icons/LinkedIn.astro';
import GithubIcon from '../components/icons/Github.astro';
import WhatsAppIcon from '../components/icons/WhatsAppIcon.astro';
import SocialPill from '../components/SocialPill.astro';
import Experiencia from '../components/Experiencia.astro';
import Proyectos from '../components/Proyectos.astro';
import SectionContainer from '../components/SectionContainer.astro'
import BriefcaseIcon from '../components/icons/BriefcaseIcon.astro';
import CodeIcon from '../components/icons/Code.astro';
---

<Layout title="Portafolio de Kevin Ilmer Quintero Mondragon - Desarrollador y programador web" 

description="Contrata a kevin ilmer quintero mondragon para crear tu aplicacion web o movil.
Desarrollador de software. Especializado en crear aplicaciones y soluciones unicas."
>
	<main>
		<SectionContainer  class="py-44 pb-24">

			
			<h1 class="text-white text-5xl font-bold flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 pb-10">
				<span class="span1">Soy </span><span class="typing inline-block">Kevin Quintero</span>
			</h1>
			<h2 class="text-2xl opacity-80 text-wrap">
				 +2 años de experiencia en el <span class="text-yellow-200/90"> Desarollo De Software.</span> De <span class="text-blue-300">Cali, Colombia.</span> Especializado en Desarrollar Soluciones Tecnologicas de <span class="text-blue-300"> Escritorio y Web.</span>
			</h2>
      <h4> <span class="text-blue-200/90">QA Engineer </span>| <span class="text-gray-200/90"> Software Developer</span> | <span class="text-blue-200/90"> Data & Automation</span> </h4>
		<nav class="flex gap-x-4 mt-8">
      <SocialPill class="flex gap-x-2" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kevin-ilmer-quintero-mondragon-81b765259/">
        <LinkedInIcon class="size-6"/>
        Linkedin
      </SocialPill>
      <SocialPill class="flex gap-x-2" href="https://github.com/kevin-quintero110">
        <GithubIcon class="size-6"/>
        GitHub
      </SocialPill>
       <SocialPill class="flex gap-x-2" href="https://wa.me/qr/3ILVDVMANSQEI1" alt="3155487003">
        <WhatsAppIcon class="size-6"/>
        WhatApp
      </SocialPill> 

    </nav>
		</SectionContainer>
    <SectionContainer id="experiencia" >
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 flex gap-x-2"><BriefcaseIcon class="size-7" /> Experiencia laboral 
        
      </h2>
      <Experiencia />
    </SectionContainer>

     <SectionContainer id="proyectos" >
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 flex gap-x-2"><CodeIcon class="size-7" /> Proyectos 
      </h2>
      <Proyectos />
    </SectionContainer>
    <SectionContainer id="info" >
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 flex gap-x-2"><CodeIcon class="size-7" /> mas informacion 
      </h2>
     <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Assumenda ipsa ipsam harum delectus, quidem rem, repellendus sit nihil nemo nam voluptates sapiente. Reiciendis minima assumenda, non laboriosam culpa blanditiis ex.</p>
    </SectionContainer>
    
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .typing {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    white-space: nowrap;
    border-right: 4px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    animation: typing 8s steps(18, end) infinite, blink 0.7s step-end infinite;
  }
  .span1{
    color: rgb(90, 20, 201);
  }

  @keyframes typing {
    0%, 10% {
      width: 0;
    }
    50% {
      width: 18ch;
    }
    60% {
      width: 18ch;
    }
    100% {
      width: 0;
    }
  }

  @keyframes blink {
    50% {
      border-color: transparent;
    }
    100% {
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    }
  }
</style>
